# Optional. Everything has a safe default; the lab needs no tenant and no credentials (it holds none).
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# This lab reads only these optional keys from it and ignores the rest:
# SIGNIN_WORKSPACE=default         # workspace id: keys the mock state, data dir and trace sink. [a-z0-9-]{1,32}
# SIGNIN_DATA_DIR=.data            # persist the trace sink as <dir>/<workspace>/trace.jsonl
# SIGNIN_CUSTOMER_CONFIG=./customer.config.json   # another customer.config.json
# Per-run settings (shell, not the shared file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# PORT=6171                        # must be in 6100-6199
# SIGNIN_BIND=127.0.0.1            # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
